      "writtenOn": "2022-08-01T03:22:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a little incongruous to me, and I\u0027m having some trouble getting my head around it.\nConditionally compiling HDMI support for an optional sub-board type may be\nbetter handled by having a separate nissa/src/hdmi.c, and remove HDMI references\nfrom this file, and having a separate HOOK_INIT in the other file for HDMI init.",
      "revId": "70ccd850dea3b0b3361eaaae37779d4ce42ca459",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1bcfea4b_233e99af",
        "filename": "zephyr/projects/nissa/src/sub_board.c",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 186,
